rent\nlanguage (locale). Default to the format in the settings.\nformat_type is the name of the format, e.g. 'DATE_FORMAT'.\n\nIf use_l10n is provided and is not None, it forces the value to\nbe localized (or not), overriding the value of settings.", "start_line": 99, "end_line": 138, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "date_format", "qualified_name": "date_format", "args": ["value", "format", "use_l10n"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Format a datetime.date or datetime.datetime object using a\nlocalizable format.\n\nIf use_l10n is provided and is not None, that will force the value to\nbe localized (or not), overriding the value of settings.USE_L10N.", "start_line": 144, "end_line": 152, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "time_format", "qualified_name": "time_format", "args": ["value", "format", "use_l10n"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Format a datetime.time object using a localizable format.\n\nIf use_l10n is provided and is not None, it forces the value to\nbe localized (or not), overriding the value of settings.USE_L10N.", "start_line": 155, "end_line": 162, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "number_format", "qualified_name": "number_format", "args": ["value", "decimal_pos", "use_l10n", "force_grouping"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Format a numeric value using localization settings.\n\nIf use_l10n is provided and is not None, it forces the value to\nbe localized (or not), overriding the value of settings.USE_L10N.", "start_line": 165, "end_line": 184, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "localize", "qualified_name": "localize", "args": ["value", "use_l10n"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Check if value is a localizable type (date, number...) and return it\nformatted as a string using current locale format.\n\nIf use_l10n is provided and is not None, it forces the value to\nbe localized (or not), overriding the value of settings.USE_L10N.", "start_line": 187, "end_line": 207, "is_async": false,