object is required so that a\nreference to it is kept with this Layer.  This prevents garbage\ncollection of the `DataSource` while this Layer is still active.", "start_line": 24, "end_line": 37, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__getitem__", "qualified_name": "__getitem__", "args": ["self", "index"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Get the Feature at the specified index.", "start_line": 39, "end_line": 53, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__iter__", "qualified_name": "__iter__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Iterate over each Feature in the Layer.", "start_line": 55, "end_line": 60, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__len__", "qualified_name": "__len__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "The length is the number of features.", "start_line": 62, "end_line": 64, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "__str__", "qualified_name": "__str__", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "The string name of the layer.", "start_line": 66, "end_line": 68, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "_make_feature", "qualified_name": "_make_feature", "args": ["self", "feat_id"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Helper routine for __getitem__ that constructs a Feature from the given\nFeature ID.  If the OGR Layer does not support random-access reading,\nthen each feature of the layer will be incremented through until the\na Feature is found matching the given feature ID.", "start_line": 70, "end_line": 90, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "extent", "qualified_name": "extent", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["property"], "docstring": "Return the extent (an Envelope) of this layer.", "start_line": 94, "end_line": 98, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "name", "qualified_name": "name", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["property"], "docstring": "Return the name of this layer in the Data Source.", "start_line": 101, "end_line": 104, "is_async": fa