s far\n        # ...\n\nNote that request methods should be in uppercase.", "start_line": 18, "end_line": 42, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "condition", "qualified_name": "condition", "args": ["etag_func", "last_modified_func"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "Decorator to support conditional retrieval (or change) for a view\nfunction.\n\nThe parameters are callables to compute the ETag and last modified time for\nthe requested resource, respectively. The callables are passed the same\nparameters as the view itself. The ETag function should return a string (or", "start_line": 55, "end_line": 112, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "etag", "qualified_name": "etag", "args": ["etag_func"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 116, "end_line": 117, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "last_modified", "qualified_name": "last_modified", "args": ["last_modified_func"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 120, "end_line": 121, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "decorator", "qualified_name": "decorator", "args": ["func"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 29, "end_line": 41, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "decorator", "qualified_name": "decorator", "args": ["func"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 77, "end_line": 111, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "inner", "qualified_name": "inner", "args": ["request"], "decorators": ["wraps(func)"], "docstring": "", "start_line": 31, "end_line": 40, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "inner", "qualified_name": "inner", "args": ["request"], "decorators": ["wraps(func)"], "docstring": "", "start_line": 79, "end_line": 109, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "get_last_modified", "qualified_name": "get_last_modified", "args": [], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 81, "end_line": 85, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}], "classes": [], "calls": [],