be redirected to their slash version.", "start_line": 123, "end_line": 131, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_append_slash_leading_slashes", "qualified_name": "test_append_slash_leading_slashes", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(APPEND_SLASH=True)"], "docstring": "Paths starting with two slashes are escaped to prevent open redirects.\nIf there's a URL pattern that allows paths to start with two slashes, a\nrequest with path //evil.com must not redirect to //evil.com/ (appended\nslash) which is a schemaless absolute URL. The browser would navigate\nto evil.com/.", "start_line": 134, "end_line": 150, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_prepend_www", "qualified_name": "test_prepend_www", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(APPEND_SLASH=False, PREPEND_WWW=True)"], "docstring": "", "start_line": 153, "end_line": 157, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_prepend_www_append_slash_have_slash", "qualified_name": "test_prepend_www_append_slash_have_slash", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(APPEND_SLASH=True, PREPEND_WWW=True)"], "docstring": "", "start_line": 160, "end_line": 164, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_prepend_www_append_slash_slashless", "qualified_name": "test_prepend_www_append_slash_slashless", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(APPEND_SLASH=True, PREPEND_WWW=True)"], "docstring": "", "start_line": 167, "end_line": 171, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_append_slash_have_slash_custom_urlconf", "qualified_name": "test_append_slash_have_slash_custom_urlconf", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(APPEND_SLASH=True)"], "docstring": "URLs with slashes should go unmolested.", "start_line": 177, "end_line": 185, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_append_slash_slashless_resource_custom_urlconf", "qualified_name": "test_append_slash_slashless_resource_custom_urlconf",