: "", "start_line": 16, "end_line": 21, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "process_response", "qualified_name": "process_response", "args": ["self"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 23, "end_line": 33, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "process_request", "qualified_name": "process_request", "args": ["self", "method"], "decorators": [], "docstring": "", "start_line": 37, "end_line": 41, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_on", "qualified_name": "test_sts_on", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS=3600)"], "docstring": "With HSTS_SECONDS=3600, the middleware adds\n\"Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=3600\" to the response.", "start_line": 44, "end_line": 52, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_already_present", "qualified_name": "test_sts_already_present", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS=3600)"], "docstring": "The middleware will not override a \"Strict-Transport-Security\" header\nalready present in the response.", "start_line": 55, "end_line": 63, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_only_if_secure", "qualified_name": "test_sts_only_if_secure", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(HSTS_SECONDS=3600)"], "docstring": "The \"Strict-Transport-Security\" header is not added to responses going\nover an insecure connection.", "start_line": 66, "end_line": 71, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_off", "qualified_name": "test_sts_off", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(HSTS_SECONDS=0)"], "docstring": "With HSTS_SECONDS of 0, the middleware does not add a\n\"Strict-Transport-Security\" header to the response.", "start_line": 74, "end_line": 79, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_include_subdomains", "qualified_name": "test_sts_include_subdomains", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS=600, SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS=True)"], "docstring": "With HSTS_SECONDS non-zero and HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS\nTrue, the middleware adds a \"Strict-Transport-Security\" header with the\n\"includeSubDomains\" directive to the response.", "start_line": 83, "end_line": 90, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_no_include_subdomains", "qualified_name": "test_sts_no_include_subdomains", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS=600, SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS=False)"], "docstring": "With HSTS_SECONDS non-zero and HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS\nFalse, the middleware adds a \"Strict-Transport-Security\" header without\nthe \"includeSubDomains\" directive to the response.", "start_line": 94, "end_line": 101, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_preload", "qualified_name": "test_sts_preload", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS=10886400, SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD=True)"], "docstring": "With HSTS_SECONDS non-zero and SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD True, the middleware\nadds a \"Strict-Transport-Security\" header with the \"preload\" directive\nto the response.", "start_line": 104, "end_line": 111, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_subdomains_and_preload", "qualified_name": "test_sts_subdomains_and_preload", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS=10886400, SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS=True, SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD=True)"], "docstring": "With HSTS_SECONDS non-zero, SECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS and\nSECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD True, the middleware adds a \"Strict-Transport-Security\"\nheader containing both the \"includeSubDomains\" and \"preload\" directives\nto the response.", "start_line": 114, "end_line": 122, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_sts_no_preload", "qualified_name": "test_sts_no_preload", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS=10886400, SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD=False)"], "docstring": "With HSTS_SECONDS non-zero and SECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD\nFalse, the middleware adds a \"Strict-Transport-Security\" header without\nthe \"preload\" directive to the response.", "start_line": 125, "end_line": 132, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_content_type_on", "qualified_name": "test_content_type_on", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF=True)"], "docstring": "With CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF set to True, the middleware adds\n\"X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff\" header to the response.", "start_line": 135, "end_line": 140, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_content_type_already_present", "qualified_name": "test_content_type_already_present", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF=True)"], "docstring": "The middleware will not override an \"X-Content-Type-Options\" header\nalready present in the response.", "start_line": 143, "end_line": 149, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_content_type_off", "qualified_name": "test_content_type_off", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF=False)"], "docstring": "With CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF False, the middleware does not add an\n\"X-Content-Type-Options\" header to the response.", "start_line": 152, "end_line": 157, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_xss_filter_on", "qualified_name": "test_xss_filter_on", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER=True)"], "docstring": "With BROWSER_XSS_FILTER set to True, the middleware adds\n\"s-xss-protection: 1; mode=block\" header to the response.", "start_line": 160, "end_line": 167, "is_async": false, "is_method": false}, {"name": "test_xss_filter_already_present", "qualified_name": "test_xss_filter_already_present", "args": ["self"], "decorators": ["override_settings(SECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER=True)"], "docstring": "The middleware will not overr